 display=\"block\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nwhich is a monomial.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement III is false. There are products of two monomials that are not binomials (see, for example, statement I and II).</p>\n<p>In fact, the product of two monomials is <em>never</em> a binomial.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
